{
	"name": "Ubrania",
	"category": "tfg:craftsmanship",
	"icon": "tfc_textile:cotton_shirt",
	"read_by_default": true,
	"sortnum": 19,
	"pages": [
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "$(item)Clothing$() is a type of $(thing)equipment$() that provides effects other than $(l:game_mechanics/damage_types)armor$().$(br2)Most clothes affect your $(l:game_mechanics/player_temperature)player temperature$(), but others can provide additional, useful effects."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"anchor": "index",
			"text": "$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#curios)About Curios$()$(li)$(bold)Early Clothing$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#straw_hat)Straw Hat$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#primitive)Primitive$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#insulated_leather)Leather$()$(li)$(bold)Advanced Clothing$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#cloth)Cloth$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#hides)Animal Hides$()$(li2)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#fully_insulated)Fully Insulating$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#table)Clothing Stats Table$()$(li)$(bold)Other Clothes$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/exploration_gear#snowshoes)Snowshoes$()$(li2)$(l:logistics/exploration_gear#snorkel)Snorkel$() and $(l:logistics/exploration_gear#flippers)Flippers$()$(li2)$(l:game_mechanics/hazards#mask)Face Mask$()$(li2)$(l:game_mechanics/hazards#gloves)Rubber Gloves$()$(li)$(bold)$(l:craftsmanship/clothing#armor_trim)Clothing Trims$()"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:image",
			"title": "Czym są Curios?",
			"anchor": "curios",
			"images": [
				"tfg:textures/gui/field_guide/curios.png"
			],
			"border": true,
			"text": "Kliknij okrągły przycisk w lewym górnym rogu Twojej postaci w pionie, aby otworzyć menu."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "Clothing can be worn in your normal equipment slots, but it can also be worn in your $(thing)Curios slots$() to wear other equipment at the same time.$(br2)This menu also has slots for things like a $(l:logistics/personal_storage#backpack)backpack$() or $(l:logistics/personal_storage#tool_belt)tool belt$()."
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "sns:straw_knapping/straw_hat",
			"anchor": "straw_hat",
			"title": "Słomiany kapelusz",
			"text": "The first item of clothing you can craft is a simple $(item)Straw Hat$(), made of $(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#thatch)straw$(). It protects you from $(l:game_mechanics/player_temperature#wetness)direct sunlight$()."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"title": "Prymitywne ubrania",
			"anchor": "primitive",
			"item": "tfc_textile:raw_hat,tfc_textile:raw_shirt,tfc_textile:raw_pants,tfc_textile:raw_socks",
			"text": "Naked and freezing in the arctic? The $(item)primitive$() set of clothing is very easy to craft, only needing some $(l:craftsmanship/building_materials#thatch)straw$() and some $(item)raw hides$(). Perfect for your caveman chic!$(br2)Primitive clothes have very low warmth, insulation, and durability, but they should buy you enough time to find something better."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:crafting",
			"recipe": "tfg:shapeless/primitive_insulation_small",
			"recipe2": "tfg:shapeless/primitive_insulation_large",
			"title": " "
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/raw_hat",
			"text": "$(l:craftsmanship/sticks_and_stones#knapping)Wycinanie$() $(item)prymitywnego kaptura$()."
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/raw_shirt",
			"text": "Wycinanie $(item)prymitywnej togi$()."
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/raw_pants",
			"text": "Wycinanie $(item)prymitywnych szortów$()."
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/raw_socks",
			"text": "Wycinanie $(item)prymitywnych butów$()."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"anchor": "insulated_leather",
			"title": "Ocieplana skóra",
			"item": "tfcambiental:insulated_leather_hat,tfcambiental:insulated_leather_tunic,tfcambiental:insulated_leather_pants,tfcambiental:insulated_leather_boots",
			"text": "$(item)Insulated Leather$() clothes are the next step up from your caveman cosplay. They only require some $(l:agriculture/leather_making)Leather$() armor, plus either $(l:agriculture/animal_husbandry#wooly_animals)raw wool$() or $(l:agriculture/animal_husbandry#oviparous_animals)feathers$()."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:crafting",
			"recipe": "tfg:shaped/insulated_leather_hat",
			"recipe2": "tfg:shaped/insulated_leather_tunic",
			"title": " "
		},
		{
			"type": "tfg:knapping_recipe",
			"recipe": "tfg:knapping/leather_apron",
			"text": "The $(l:agriculture/leather_making)Leather$() $(item)Apron$() provides a lot of insulation, but no warmth or cooling. Perfect for working in front of a $(l:craftsmanship/charcoal_forge)forge$()!"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"title": "Ubrania z tkanin",
			"anchor": "cloth",
			"item": "tag:forge:cloth",
			"text": "For stronger, longer-term protection, you'll want to look at making some proper clothes out of various $(l:agriculture/weaving)cloths$(). $(l:agriculture/animal_husbandry#wooly_animals)Wool$() and $(l:beneath/beneath_crops#cotton)Cotton$() clothes will warm you up, while $(l:the_world/wild_crops#flax)Linen$(), $(l:the_world/wild_crops#jute)Burlap$(), and $(l:beneath/beneath#webbed_lair)Silk$() clothes will cool you down.$(br)These have a bigger up-front investment, but have a lot more durability and can be cheaply repaired."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:crafting",
			"title": " ",
			"recipe": "tfg:shaped/cotton_shirt",
			"recipe2": "tfg:shaped/burlap_pants"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"item": "tag:tfc_textile:animal_furs",
			"anchor": "hides",
			"title": "Skóry zwierząt",
			"text": "The hides and furs of various animals can be used to create some of the strongest clothing in $(tfg_short), boasting the best stats and durability of anything else. They all have different stats depending on how difficult they are to obtain, or where you would find the corresponding animal."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:text",
			"text": "For example, $(l:the_world/wild_animals#crocodile)crocodile clothing$() will cool you down, while a $(l:the_world/wild_animals#caribou)caribou parka$() would be nice and toasty.$(br2)The strongest cooling clothes will require a trip to somewhere $(l:beneath/beneath_mechanics#clothes)quite hot$()...$(br2)These can also all be easily repaired."
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:crafting",
			"title": " ",
			"recipe": "tfg:shaped/caribou_shirt",
			"recipe2": "tfg:shaped/crocodile_shirt"
		},
		{
			"type": "patchouli:spotlight",
			"anchor": "fully_insulated",
			"title": "Pełna izolacja",
			"item": "gtceu:nanomuscle_chestplate,ad_astra:space_suit",
			"text": "Lastly, some advanced armors will also provide $(thing)full insulation$() from the outside world, preventing your $(l:game_mechanics/player_temperature)player temperature$() from going lower than 5°C or above 25°C."
		},
